# Browser for UI verification

Use the Cursor IDE browser MCP only (`browser_navigate`, `browser_lock`, `browser_snapshot`, `browser_take_screenshot`, `browser_click`).

Do not use Playwright, playwright-cli, `npx playwright`, Puppeteer, or a headed Chromium from the shell unless the user explicitly asks.

If the MCP browser is missing, stop and say so. Do not install or run Playwright as a substitute.
